{
  "description": "USD per 1M tokens per model id, used by the retrospective to price each task. A model id matches exactly or by the longest id prefix. long_context replaces every rate of a call whose prompt (input plus cache tokens) passes above_prompt_tokens. A project overrides or adds models in .agentrof/pricing.json with the same models shape.",
